profile.POTATO=Potato
profile.LITE=Lite
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.HIGH=High
profile.comment=Potato: sky shadows only, the most FPS. Lite: real sun shadows and box clouds, made for phones. Medium: soft shadows. High: everything on, including reflections, sun rays, held-item lights and depth of field.


